Package: dazestack-wp
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash (>= 5.0), curl, jq, tar
Description: Production-ready automated WordPress LEMP platform
 DazeStack WP automates and operates an isolated WordPress LEMP stack for
 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS (Noble) and Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (Resolute) with per-site PHP-FPM
 pools, Nginx native HTTP/3 QUIC, MariaDB 11.4 LTS, and Redis Unix domain
 socket caching.
